alid key:\n```javascript\nconst key = 20865;\nconst value = math.powSystemConstants.expSystemConstants.com_defs[key];\nconsole.log(value); // Should log 1888\n```\n\nBy following these steps, you should be able to add the desired definitions to your `expSystemConstants.tmpPath` file and ensure they are stored correctly in the database.",
